    "name": "Zimal Store — Seller Onboarding (Phase 6: Admin Store Control + Bank Proof)",
    "description": "Phase 6 manual test.\n\nBEFORE YOU START\n1) php artisan migrate   (Phase 6 adds columns to seller_profiles)\n2) keep `php artisan queue:work` running — emails and audit rows are queued\n3) you need at least ONE approved store (Phase 3 collection -> 3a APPROVE)\n4) the admin and the store owner must be DIFFERENT accounts —\n   an admin can never act on their own store (403)\n\nTOKENS: folder 0 fills {{admin_token}} and {{seller_token}}.\nEvery request already points at the right one.\n\nORDER: 0 -> 1 (list, saves store_id) -> 2 (suspend/reactivate)\n       -> 3 (bank proof: seller uploads, admin reviews) -> 4 (errors).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
